    <div class="mt-auto"><div class="border-t border-[#e5e8e6] pt-5 space-y-1"><button class="nav-item"><Settings :size="20"/><span v-if="!leftCollapsed">Settings</span></button><button class="nav-item"><HelpCircle :size="20"/><span v-if="!leftCollapsed">Help & Support</span></button></div><div v-if="!leftCollapsed" class="px-3 pt-7 pb-1"><div class="text-[17px] font-medium leading-tight">Less typing.<br/>More care.</div><div class="w-6 h-px bg-[#263b37] my-4"/><p class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">Clavis helps you focus<br/>on what matters.</p></div></div>
